• While constructing the proofs, I found the security predicates need explicit entry configurations: quantifying over arbitrary machine configurations would include unrelated control states, not just equal-public-input program entries. I’m tightening them to entry-indexed claims over complete finite runs, which is the execution property the examples can honestly prove.

